{"id":"n67837-1-11","stage":3,"title":"온갖 · 种种","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67837-1-11-1","ko":"승규가 또 대학에 떨어졌대요.","zh":"听说承奎又没考上大学呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규가","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}},{"text":"또","meaning":"又","explanation":"또：又。","readings":[{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"51887","senseId":"1","lemma":"또","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"또","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3"}},{"text":"대학에","meaning":"大学","explanation":"대학：大学；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"대학","audio":"/audio/a5aac0eac3be8a9556cb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61281","senseId":"1","lemma":"대학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대학에","audio":"/audio/0ce50ae6743a41c2a9c3.mp3"}},{"text":"떨어졌대요.","meaning":"落榜","explanation":"떨어지다：落榜；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；대요：口语中礼貌地转述听来的话。","readings":[{"term":"떨어지다","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89796","senseId":"9","lemma":"떨어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떨어졌대요","audio":"/audio/0d57539c4e4b5337d098.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c7c5916d2df73410","term":"또","zh":"又","audio":"/audio/c7c5916d2df73410dd21.mp3","entryId":"51887","definition":"某件事情或行为再次发生。","pronunciation":["또"]},{"id":"a5aac0eac3be8a95","term":"대학","zh":"大学","audio":"/audio/a5aac0eac3be8a9556cb.mp3","entryId":"61281","definition":"高中毕业后进入的高等教育机构。","pronunciation":["대ː학"]},{"id":"5360fef914150d39","term":"떨어지다","zh":"落榜","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3","entryId":"89796","definition":"未能通过考试、选拔等。","pronunciation":["떠러지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b065e058f7d914470a78.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67837-1-11-2","ko":"어머니가 승규 대학 보내려고 온갖 정성을 다했는데, 정말 안됐